    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but how can it not be the truth though? people say \"it's just a symptom\" but that feels like such a lie. actions have consequences. i did something that can't be undone, and now i just exist as this constant reminder of a failure. it feels like the world would just be cleaner if i wasn't in it, like i'm just taking up space that could be used for something actually good.",
