    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say to reach out but it feels so selfish. everyone else is already dealing with the fallout of what i did. if i ask for help, im just making them deal with me too. it's like i'm just a source of more problems. sometimes it feels like the only way to actually be responsible for what i've done is to just stop being a factor in the equation altogether. like, wouldn't it be more peaceful for everyone if i just wasn't a part of this anymore?",
